        <title>DisplayAnchor</title>
        <item>
            <title>1.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:15:21 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/gabriarceus/DisplayAnchor</link>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description>&lt;style&gt;
.release-notes {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
}
.release-notes h1 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.35);
}
.release-notes h2 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
}
.release-notes h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 14px 0 8px;
}
.release-notes p {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
}
.release-notes hr {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.35);
    margin: 16px 0;
}
.release-notes code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 1px 4px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.2);
}
.release-notes .note-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
}
.release-notes .note-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px;
}
.release-notes .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}
.release-notes .badge-added { background: #2da44e; }
.release-notes .badge-changed { background: #6e40c9; }
.release-notes .badge-fixed { background: #d97706; }
.release-notes .badge-removed { background: #cf222e; }
.release-notes .note-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
}
.release-notes .note-sublist {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    padding-left: 14px;
    list-style-type: none;
}
.release-notes .note-sublist li::before {
    content: "– ";
    opacity: 0.75;
}
.release-notes .plain-list {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    padding-left: 20px;
}
.release-notes details {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
}
.release-notes summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 500;
    user-select: none;
}
.release-notes details[open] summary {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;div class="release-notes"&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;DisplayAnchor 1.3.0&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Improvements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="note-list"&gt;
&lt;div class="note-item"&gt;&lt;span class="badge badge-changed"&gt;IMPROVE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class="note-text"&gt;Display rotation finishes as soon as macOS reports the new orientation and steady geometry instead of waiting a fixed delay, while still repairing late resets from slower GPUs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="note-item"&gt;&lt;span class="badge badge-changed"&gt;IMPROVE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class="note-text"&gt;The update window shows category badges for each change and collapses the two previous versions under expandable sections.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bug fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="note-list"&gt;
&lt;div class="note-item"&gt;&lt;span class="badge badge-fixed"&gt;FIX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class="note-text"&gt;Choosing Install in Settings or clicking the update notification closes the panel and brings the update window to the front.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;DisplayAnchor 1.2.2&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Show DisplayAnchor 1.2.2 release notes&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bug fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="note-list"&gt;
&lt;div class="note-item"&gt;&lt;span class="badge badge-fixed"&gt;FIX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class="note-text"&gt;Rotating a display from the right-click menu, or restoring a saved layout with a rotated display, turns the picture and keeps the resolutions and the arrangement of all displays. A rotation can take several seconds, and the panel controls wait until it ends.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;DisplayAnchor 1.2.1&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Show DisplayAnchor 1.2.1 release notes&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bug fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="note-list"&gt;
&lt;div class="note-item"&gt;&lt;span class="badge badge-fixed"&gt;FIX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class="note-text"&gt;The right-click Rotate menu on a display shows a checkmark for the currently active rotation angle.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="note-item"&gt;&lt;span class="badge badge-fixed"&gt;FIX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class="note-text"&gt;When the language setting is set to System, the app follows the macOS system language instead of defaulting to English.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/gabriarceus/DisplayAnchor/releases/download/v1.3.0/DisplayAnchor-1.3.0.zip" length="4188082" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="7MbwOcU9sWyi20K/V5bTiiJTVoa6WUsMGvIPwMQaSX516iGFQ5IufzOTmFRIPU+mj3+uvic0q9EpQkjdYNknCQ==" />
